{"id":"b022673471b8fbb9","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-split-dtt-structure.md","title":"强 DTT 的严格语境族结构","display":"df-split-dtt-structure — 强 DTT 的严格语境族结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-split-dtt-structure","aliases":["16-df-split-dtt-structure"],"display":"df-split-dtt-structure — 强 DTT 的严格语境族结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§10.1 pp.585–591 (PDF 605–611); §10.3 pp.603–608 (PDF 623–628); §10.4 pp.612–613 (PDF 632–633)","formalization_scope":"Strict CwF presentation of 1, Pi, strong Sigma, strong extensional Eq","verification_basis":"Typed algebraic record; beta-eta and strict substitution laws explicitly expanded"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-split-dtt-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-split-dtt-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-split-dtt-structure — 强 DTT 的严格语境族结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.1 pp.585–591 (PDF 605–611); §10.3 pp.603–608 (PDF 623–628); §10.4 pp.612–613 (PDF 632–633)"},{"key":"formalization_scope","html":"Strict CwF presentation of 1, Pi, strong Sigma, strong extensional Eq"},{"key":"verification_basis","html":"Typed algebraic record; beta-eta and strict substitution laws explicitly expanded"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>工作在足以容纳所用集合的元理论宇宙中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为小范畴，含对象、Hom、恒等和复合；其精确公理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\)</span> 是对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:\\Theta\\to\\Delta\">\\(\\tau:\\Theta\\to\\Delta\\)</span> 是态射。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>候选记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 含终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1\">\\(\\mathbf1\\)</span> 及终态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_\\Gamma\">\\(!_\\Gamma\\)</span>，集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span>，类型/项重索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[\\sigma]\">\\(a[\\sigma]\\)</span>，扩张对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span>，投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_A:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma\">\\(p_A:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma\\)</span>，泛项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_A\">\\(q_A\\)</span>，配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\sigma,a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\sigma,a\\rangle\\)</span>，以及下式规定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}\">\\(1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}\\)</span> 操作。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{A,B},\\operatorname{app}_{A,B},\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B},\\operatorname{fst}_{A,B},\\operatorname{snd}_{A,B}\">\\(\\lambda_{A,B},\\operatorname{app}_{A,B},\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B},\\operatorname{fst}_{A,B},\\operatorname{snd}_{A,B}\\)</span> 是保留全部型属参数的函数族；以下无下标的出现按同一局部参数展开，作用于重索引后的项时其指标也相应重索引。下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\Pi,\\Sigma\">\\(\\lambda,\\Pi,\\Sigma\\)</span> 为记录操作而非元理论函数空间；所有等号均为元理论中的严格相等。使用依赖多类元语言：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma.A)\">\\(B\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma.A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,B)\">\\(b\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Pi(A,B))\">\\(f\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Pi(A,B))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(A,B))\">\\(P\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(A,B))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的类在其出现的公式中注明。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathsf U(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是该公式按这些类声明的独立普遍闭包，不能把几个公式共同闭包后使整个条件因某个空项类而真空。型属声明是按每个公式所在局部模式读取的有限无环依赖多类参数表（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_2\">\\(\\mathsf C_2\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^{\\prime}\">\\(a^{\\prime}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_6\">\\(\\mathsf C_6\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^{\\prime}\">\\(a^{\\prime}\\)</span> 是不同局部元变量）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_v\">\\(D_v\\)</span> 为该局部变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的声明域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 为该模式参数表的有限变量集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> 在本原子指相对于固定记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的元语言自由变量函数。闭包先加入各声明域的自由参数，再按依赖顺序量化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 的完整范畴公理取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>；本原子不另增范畴论外部原语。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\land\\ \\bigwedge_{r=1}^{6}\\mathsf C_r(S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\land\\ \\bigwedge_{r=1}^{6}\\mathsf C_r(S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\mid\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq P\\ \\land\\ (\\forall v\\in P)\\ \\operatorname{FV}(D_v)\\subseteq P\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf U(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_1\\in D_{v_1}\\cdots\\forall v_k\\in D_{v_k}\\ \\varphi,\n\\qquad P_\\varphi=\\{v_1,\\ldots,v_k\\},\\qquad\n(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\})\\ \\operatorname{FV}(D_{v_i})\\subseteq\\{v_j\\mid1\\leq j&lt;i\\},\\\\\n\\sigma^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\sigma p_{A[\\sigma]},q_{A[\\sigma]}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bar a\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma,a\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\mid\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq P\\ \\land\\ (\\forall v\\in P)\\ \\operatorname{FV}(D_v)\\subseteq P\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf U(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_1\\in D_{v_1}\\cdots\\forall v_k\\in D_{v_k}\\ \\varphi,\n\\qquad P_\\varphi=\\{v_1,\\ldots,v_k\\},\\qquad\n(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\})\\ \\operatorname{FV}(D_{v_i})\\subseteq\\{v_j\\mid1\\leq j&lt;i\\},\\\\\n\\sigma^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\sigma p_{A[\\sigma]},q_{A[\\sigma]}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bar a\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma,a\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_1(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,\\mathbf1)=\\{!_\\Gamma\\})\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Delta))\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\operatorname{id}]=A)\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma\\tau]=A[\\sigma][\\tau])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\operatorname{id}]=a)\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma\\tau]=a[\\sigma][\\tau]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_1(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,\\mathbf1)=\\{!_\\Gamma\\})\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Delta))\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\operatorname{id}]=A)\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma\\tau]=A[\\sigma][\\tau])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\operatorname{id}]=a)\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma\\tau]=a[\\sigma][\\tau]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_2(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(p_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma.A,\\Gamma))\\land\\mathsf U(q_A\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,A[p_A]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A))\n\\land\\mathsf U(p_A\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle=\\sigma)\\land\\mathsf U(q_A[\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle]=a&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle p_Ah,q_A[h]\\rangle=h),\\qquad\na&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]),\\quad h\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_2(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(p_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma.A,\\Gamma))\\land\\mathsf U(q_A\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,A[p_A]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A))\n\\land\\mathsf U(p_A\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle=\\sigma)\\land\\mathsf U(q_A[\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle]=a&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle p_Ah,q_A[h]\\rangle=h),\\qquad\na&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]),\\quad h\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_3(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(1_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,1_\\Gamma)=\\{*_\\Gamma\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(1_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=1_\\Delta)\\land\\mathsf U(*_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=*_\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_3(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(1_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,1_\\Gamma)=\\{*_\\Gamma\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(1_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=1_\\Delta)\\land\\mathsf U(*_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=*_\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_4(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Pi_\\Gamma(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda_{A,B}(b)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Pi(A,B)))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}(f,a)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda(b),a)=b[\\bar a])\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda(\\operatorname{app}(f[p_A],q_A))=f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Pi(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\Pi(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda(b)[\\sigma]=\\lambda(b[\\sigma^+]))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}(f,a)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{app}(f[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_4(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Pi_\\Gamma(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda_{A,B}(b)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Pi(A,B)))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}(f,a)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda(b),a)=b[\\bar a])\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda(\\operatorname{app}(f[p_A],q_A))=f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Pi(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\Pi(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda(b)[\\sigma]=\\lambda(b[\\sigma^+]))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}(f,a)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{app}(f[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_5(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Sigma_\\Gamma(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}(a,b&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(A,B)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}_{A,B}(P)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}_{A,B}(P)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\overline{\\operatorname{fst}(P)}]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b&#39;))=a)\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b&#39;))=b&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}(\\operatorname{fst}(P),\\operatorname{snd}(P))=P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Sigma(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\Sigma(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b&#39;)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{pair}(a[\\sigma],b&#39;[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}(P)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fst}(P[\\sigma]))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}(P)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{snd}(P[\\sigma])),\\qquad b&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_5(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Sigma_\\Gamma(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}(a,b&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(A,B)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}_{A,B}(P)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}_{A,B}(P)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\overline{\\operatorname{fst}(P)}]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b&#39;))=a)\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b&#39;))=b&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}(\\operatorname{fst}(P),\\operatorname{snd}(P))=P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Sigma(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\Sigma(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b&#39;)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{pair}(a[\\sigma],b&#39;[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}(P)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fst}(P[\\sigma]))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}(P)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{snd}(P[\\sigma])),\\qquad b&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_6(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Eq}_\\Gamma(A,a,a&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a&#39;))\\Longrightarrow a=a&#39;\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a&#39;))\\Longrightarrow e=\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a&#39;)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{Eq}(A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma],a&#39;[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{refl}(A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])),\\qquad\na&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A),\\quad e\\in\\bigcup_{T\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)}\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_6(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Eq}_\\Gamma(A,a,a&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a&#39;))\\Longrightarrow a=a&#39;\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a&#39;))\\Longrightarrow e=\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a&#39;)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{Eq}(A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma],a&#39;[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{refl}(A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])),\\qquad\na&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A),\\quad e\\in\\bigcup_{T\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)}\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是原书强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\Pi,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Eq}\">\\(1,\\Pi,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Eq}\\)</span> 片段的严格语境族（CwF）呈现。六条条件全部展开，模型不是只保持某些对象同构的普通函子。CwF 是此处用于处理句法判断相等与代表选择的严格呈现术语；原书使用 comprehension category 和 display maps。</li>\n<li>理解的配对唯一性立即给出沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的投影拉回：顶部箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^+\">\\(\\sigma^+\\)</span>，介导箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle h,t\\rangle\">\\(\\langle h,t\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> 的 βη 给出沿投影削弱的伴随双射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的三条方程给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A.B\\cong\\Gamma.\\Sigma(A,B)\">\\(\\Gamma.A.B\\cong\\Gamma.\\Sigma(A,B)\\)</span>；强 Eq 的反射和唯一性精确对应本书强相等，未被解释成任意内涵 J 类型。</li>\n<li>所有操作的参数来自记录中所声明的集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^+\">\\(\\sigma^+\\)</span> 的目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span>，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta.A[\\sigma]\">\\(\\Delta.A[\\sigma]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\">\\(\\bar a\\)</span> 的目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span>，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>。这些类型保证 βη 与自然性公式两边属于同一个项集合。</li>\n<li>来源对应：§10.1 pp.585–591（PDF 605–611）；§10.3 引理 10.3.1 pp.603–604（PDF 623–624），命题 10.3.2–10.3.3 pp.605–608（PDF 625–628）；§10.4 pp.612–613（PDF 632–633）。严格 CwF 记录是本次重建，不是原书逐字定义，也不声称已证明与所有非分裂 comprehension 模型的等价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"工作在足以容纳所用集合的元理论宇宙中。$\\mathcal C$ 为小范畴，含对象、Hom、恒等和复合；其精确公理见 [[16-df-category]]。$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta$ 是对象，$\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma$、$\\tau:\\Theta\\to\\Delta$ 是态射。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)$ 的完整范畴公理取 [[16-df-category]]；本原子不另增范畴论外部原语。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:\\Theta\\to\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1","display":false},{"tex":"!_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"a[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"p_A:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"q_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\sigma,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_{A,B},\\operatorname{app}_{A,B},\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B},\\operatorname{fst}_{A,B},\\operatorname{snd}_{A,B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\Pi,\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma.A)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Pi(A,B))","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(A,B))","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf U(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_2","display":false},{"tex":"a^{\\prime}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_6","display":false},{"tex":"a^{\\prime}","display":false},{"tex":"D_v","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\land\\ \\bigwedge_{r=1}^{6}\\mathsf C_r(S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\mid\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq P\\ \\land\\ (\\forall v\\in P)\\ \\operatorname{FV}(D_v)\\subseteq P\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf U(\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\forall v_1\\in D_{v_1}\\cdots\\forall v_k\\in D_{v_k}\\ \\varphi,\n\\qquad P_\\varphi=\\{v_1,\\ldots,v_k\\},\\qquad\n(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\})\\ \\operatorname{FV}(D_{v_i})\\subseteq\\{v_j\\mid1\\leq j<i\\},\\\\\n\\sigma^+&\\coloneqq\\langle\\sigma p_{A[\\sigma]},q_{A[\\sigma]}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bar a\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma,a\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_1(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,\\mathbf1)=\\{!_\\Gamma\\})\\ \\land\\\\\n&\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Delta))\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\operatorname{id}]=A)\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma\\tau]=A[\\sigma][\\tau])\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\operatorname{id}]=a)\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma\\tau]=a[\\sigma][\\tau]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_2(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(p_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma.A,\\Gamma))\\land\\mathsf U(q_A\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,A[p_A]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle\\sigma,a'\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A))\n\\land\\mathsf U(p_A\\langle\\sigma,a'\\rangle=\\sigma)\\land\\mathsf U(q_A[\\langle\\sigma,a'\\rangle]=a')\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle p_Ah,q_A[h]\\rangle=h),\\qquad\na'\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]),\\quad h\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_3(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(1_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,1_\\Gamma)=\\{*_\\Gamma\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(1_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=1_\\Delta)\\land\\mathsf U(*_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=*_\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_4(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(\\Pi_\\Gamma(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda_{A,B}(b)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Pi(A,B)))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}(f,a)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda(b),a)=b[\\bar a])\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda(\\operatorname{app}(f[p_A],q_A))=f)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\Pi(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\Pi(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma^+]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda(b)[\\sigma]=\\lambda(b[\\sigma^+]))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}(f,a)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{app}(f[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_5(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(\\Sigma_\\Gamma(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}(a,b')\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(A,B)))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}_{A,B}(P)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}_{A,B}(P)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\overline{\\operatorname{fst}(P)}]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b'))=a)\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b'))=b')\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}(\\operatorname{fst}(P),\\operatorname{snd}(P))=P)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\Sigma(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\Sigma(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma^+]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b')[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{pair}(a[\\sigma],b'[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{fst}(P)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fst}(P[\\sigma]))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{snd}(P)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{snd}(P[\\sigma])),\\qquad b'\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_6(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Eq}_\\Gamma(A,a,a')\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a)))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a'))\\Longrightarrow a=a'\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(e\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a'))\\Longrightarrow e=\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Eq}(A,a,a')[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{Eq}(A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma],a'[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{refl}(A,a)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{refl}(A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])),\\qquad\na'\\in\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,A),\\quad e\\in\\bigcup_{T\\in\\operatorname{Ty}(\\Gamma)}\\operatorname{Tm}(\\Gamma,T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1,\\Pi,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Eq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle h,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A.B\\cong\\Gamma.\\Sigma(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta.A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":8422,"backlinks":[{"id":"64dd825bd60fb1b8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用含选择公理的集合论，固定足够大的 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$；$S\\in\\mathcal U$ 满足 [[16-df-split-dtt-structure]] 的 $\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S)$。它的基范畴、类型、项和所选操作分别记作 $\\mathcal C_S,\\operatorname{Ty}_S,\\operatorname{Tm}_S$ 及该页记号。以下语法和声明集合均在 $\\mathcal U$ 中。"},{"id":"4fdfa4186458cce8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$M=(S,\\rho)$、$N=(S',\\rho')$ 满足 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 的 $\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma$。$\\mathcal C_S,\\operatorname{Ty}_S,\\operatorname{Tm}_S$ 及全部结构操作采用 [[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]。"},{"id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$ 及原始语法、判断、替换见 [[16-df-dtt-signature]]。$S$ 是 [[16-df-split-dtt-structure]] 的候选记录，使用其中的类型、项、配对与各构造操作。"},{"id":"d0c7afd20e93018d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-split-dtt-structure]] 的候选记录格式及谓词 $\\mathsf{SplitDTT}$；本例不预先假定构造的记录满足它。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]、[[16-df-term-model]]、[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]、[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]、[[16-df-identity-type]]、[[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]、[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]、[[16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection]]。DTT 结果使用明确的强片段与严格态射；FHoDTT 的可靠性和完备性使用匹配其语法的两 sort 严格模型。内部语言评价是否覆盖整个模型，由语境生成条件判定。"}],"outgoing":["25a281534aa42440"]}